@startuml C4-Dynamic-ScimProvisioning
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Dynamic — SCIM Provisioning (Enterprise IdP → Explore IAM → Explore AI)

autonumber
participant "Enterprise IdP\nOkta / Entra ID" as idp <<external>>
participant "IAM SCIM Server\n/scim/v2" as scim <<java>>
participant "Identity Services\nUser · Group" as identity <<java>>
participant "Synchronous handlers\nAdminActivityRecorder ·\nFederationLinkService" as handlers <<java>>
database "Metadata DB\nusers · groups · event_publication" as db <<db>>
participant "ScimPushListener\n@ApplicationModuleListener" as listener <<java>>
participant "ScimTargetClient\nRestClient + OAuth2" as client <<java>>
participant "IAM OIDC Provider\n/oauth2/token" as token <<java>>
participant "Explore AI\n/scim/v2/Users" as ai <<external>>

== Inbound: IdP provisions IAM ==
idp -> token: client_credentials (scope write:iam_scim)
token --> idp: Access Token
idp -> scim: POST /Users · PUT · PATCH · DELETE\nPOST /Groups · PATCH members
scim -> scim: SCOPE_write:iam_scim\nIf-Match vs W/"version" → 412 on mismatch
scim -> identity: provisionUser / replace / disableUser / deleteUser
identity -> db: Save aggregate
identity -> handlers: publishEvent (same transaction)\nUserProvisionedEvent, UserDeactivatedEvent,\nUserDeletionRequestedEvent, GroupMembershipChangedEvent …
handlers -> db: AdminActivity identity:* (actor = scim-provisioner)\ndelete FederatedIdentity links before the user row
identity -> db: Event publication for after-commit listeners
scim --> idp: 201 / 200 / 204 + ETag

== Outbound: IAM pushes to Explore AI (after commit, async) ==
db -> listener: Event (ids only)
listener -> listener: Load ProvisioningTarget\nassigned? (assignment group)\nalready synced at this version? → skip
listener -> client: create / replace / setActive(false) / delete
client -> token: client_credentials iam-scim-outbound\n(scope write:ai_scim, cached)
token --> client: Access Token
alt Known remote id or found by externalId
  client -> ai: PUT /Users/{id}
else New account
  client -> ai: POST /Users (externalId = IAM user id)
  opt 409 uniqueness
    client -> ai: GET /Users?filter=externalId eq "…" → PUT
  end
end
ai --> client: 200 / 201 / 204
client --> listener: remote id
listener -> db: Record ProvisionedAccount (remote id, synced version)\ncomplete publication (deleted)

== Failure and recovery ==
alt 5xx / 429 / I/O error
  client -> client: @Retryable backoff (Retry-After ≤ 10 s)
else Retries exhausted
  listener -> db: Publication stays incomplete
  db -> listener: ProvisioningResubmitter (every 5 min)\n+ republish on restart
end

note over idp, ai
  Unassigned / deactivated → PATCH active=false (account kept, marked stale)
  IAM user deleted → DELETE on every target holding a Provisioned Account
  Deleted or disabled users get no new tokens and lose live sessions; users resolve by IAM user id, never by username
end note

@enduml
